{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cuv","name":"新標點和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CUV","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (traditional)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"923f114ccc6ab7fc558e054f84df5214fa9782ca7c02882cf173417a0d1d641e","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ISA","translationId":"cmn_cuv","name":"以賽亞書","commonName":"以賽亞書","title":"以賽亞書","order":23,"numberOfChapters":66,"sha256":"921a220806f68d66de57b27dd59223eb1b066e8d56be04c3105a8636a6e23e70","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ISA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":66,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ISA/66.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1290},"chapter":{"number":9,"content":[{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["但那受過痛苦的必不再見幽暗。 未來的君王 從前上帝使西布倫地和拿弗他利地被藐視，末後卻使這沿海的路，約旦河外，外邦人的加利利地得着榮耀。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"text":"在黑暗中行走的百姓看見了大光；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"住在死蔭之地的人有光照耀他們。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你使這國民繁多，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"加增他們的喜樂；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們在你面前歡喜，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"好像收割的歡喜，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"像人分擄物那樣的快樂。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為他們所負的重軛","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"和肩頭上的杖，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"並欺壓他們人的棍，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你都已經折斷，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"好像在米甸的日子一樣。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"戰士在亂殺之間所穿戴的盔甲，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"並那滾在血中的衣服，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"都必作為可燒的，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"當作火柴。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因有一嬰孩為我們而生；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"有一子賜給我們。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"政權必擔在他的肩頭上；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他名稱為「奇妙策士、全能的上帝、永在的父、和平的君」。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他的政權與平安必加增無窮。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他必在大衛的寶座上治理他的國，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以公平公義使國堅定穩固，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"從今直到永遠。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"萬軍之耶和華的熱心必成就這事。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"heading","content":["耶和華要懲罰以色列"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"text":"主使一言入於雅各家，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"落於以色列家。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這眾百姓，就是以法蓮","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"和撒馬利亞的居民，都要知道；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們憑驕傲自大的心說：","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"磚牆塌了，我們卻要鑿石頭建築；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"桑樹砍了，我們卻要換香柏樹。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因此，耶和華要高舉利汛的敵人","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"來攻擊以色列，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"並要激動以色列的仇敵。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"東有亞蘭人，西有非利士人；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們張口要吞吃以色列。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"雖然如此，耶和華的怒氣還未轉消；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他的手仍伸不縮。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"text":"這百姓還沒有歸向擊打他們的主，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"也沒有尋求萬軍之耶和華。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因此，耶和華一日之間","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"必從以色列中剪除頭與尾，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"棕枝與蘆葦－","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"長老和尊貴人就是頭，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以謊言教人的先知就是尾。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為，引導這百姓的使他們走錯了路；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"被引導的都必敗亡。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"所以，主必不喜悅他們的少年人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"也不憐恤他們的孤兒寡婦；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為，各人是褻瀆的，是行惡的，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"並且各人的口都說愚妄的話。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"雖然如此，耶和華的怒氣還未轉消；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他的手仍伸不縮。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":[{"text":"邪惡像火焚燒，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"燒滅荊棘和蒺藜，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在稠密的樹林中着起來，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"就成為煙柱，旋轉上騰。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因萬軍之耶和華的烈怒，地都燒遍；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"百姓成為火柴；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"無人憐愛弟兄。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"有人右邊搶奪，仍受飢餓，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"左邊吞吃，仍不飽足；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"各人吃自己膀臂上的肉。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"瑪拿西吞吃","poem":1},{"noteId":7},{"text":"以法蓮；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以法蓮吞吃瑪拿西，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"又一同攻擊猶大。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"雖然如此，耶和華的怒氣還未轉消；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他的手仍伸不縮。","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":7,"caller":"-","text":"或譯：攻擊；下同","reference":{"chapter":9,"verse":21}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ISA/9.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ISA/10.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ISA/8.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":21}